"id\\\": \\\"g026\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Jin dynasty clerical script form of 暘\\\",\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"historical_form\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"g027\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Traditional regular script form of 暘\\\",\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"historical_form\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"g028\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Simplified regular script form of 旸\\\",\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"historical_form\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"uncertainties\\\": []\\n}\",\n/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0614/p001-identification-evidence-20261003/verified-occurrences.json:11:    \"anchor\": \"此字也通作\",\n/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0614/p001-identification-evidence-20261003/verified-occurrences.json:41:      \"candidate\": \"駒 U+99D2 (馬 + 句)\",\n/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0614/p001-identification-evidence-20261003/verified-occurrences.json:45:      \"character\": \"馰\",\n/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0614/p001-identification-evidence-20261003/verified-occurrences.json:49:    \"geometry_task\": \"Inspect the complete target in the source and enlarged crops. Compare the right-side interior with the actual printed 勺 (U+52FA) in the quotation 从日，勺声 on the same p614 paragraph. 勺 has a dot/open-hook interior; 句 (U+53E5) has a closed 口. State the target geometry and control geometry separately, with attachment references. Do not normalize, simplify, or substitute the left 馬 (U+99AC). Do not rely on meaning, OCR placeholder, or the earlier 駒 verdict. If the source pixels do not show the right-side interior clearly, return unresolved_identity with null printed_text.\"\n/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0614/p001-identification-evidence-20261003/verified-occurrences.json:57:        \"printed_text\": \"馰\",\n/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0614/p001-identification-evidence-20261003/verified-occurrences.json:59:        \"reason\": \"In attachment 3, the complete target immediately follows the paragraph’s “此字也通作” anchor. Its right-side interior shows a dot and an open hook, not a closed 口. Attachment 2 shows the printed control 勺 in “从日，勺声”: that control also has a dot and open-hook interior. The target’s visible right side matches 勺, supporting 馰; the scan therefore distinguishes it from the proposed 駒 with a closed 口.\"\n/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0614/p001-identification-evidence-20261003/overlay-occurrence-binding.json:6:  \"raw_literal\": \"駒\",\n/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0614/ocr-corrected.json:16:    \"text\": \"旱 昧 晤 昭 晤 的 晄 旭 晉 暘 昝 晹\\n\\n1《说文》137页。2、3《篆隶表》443页。\\n形声字。《说文》：“的，明也。从日，勺声。《易》曰：为的颡。”段玉裁注：“的者，白之明也。故俗字作的。”引申为“明确”之义。《礼记·中庸》：“小人之道，的然而日亡。”而《说文》所引的《易》，今本《易·说卦传》：“为的颡。”“的”是指白额头的马，此字也通作“馰”。古书所谓“的卢马”就是指一种黑白相间的马。“的”是指“白”，“卢”是指“黑”。至于“的”的其他义项详见“的”字诸条。(王志平)\\n\\n晄(晃) huǎng 匣纽、阳部;匣纽、荡韵、胡广切。\\nhuàng 匣纽、阳部;匣纽、荡韵、胡广切。\\n[glyph:g001]《说文》小篆—[glyph:g002]汉—[glyph:g003]楷书\\n[glyph:g004]魏晋—[glyph:g005]楷书\\n1《说文》137页。2、3《篆隶表》443页。\\n形声字。《说文》：“晄，明也。从日，光声。”“光”也有“明”的意思，所以“晄”字の本义就是“光明”，引申为“耀眼”等等。俗语“晃眼”之“晃”就是用的此义。此读为huǎng。亦假借为“爌”、“曠”等等。《汉书·扬雄传上》：“北爌幽州。”颜师古注：“爌，古晃字。”而用作“晃动”之“晃”则念 huàng。“晄”今隶定为“晃”。(王志平)\\n\\n旭 xù 晓纽、觉部;晓纽、烛韵、许玉切。\\nhào 晓纽、幽部;晓纽、皓韵、许皓切。\\n[glyph:g006]《说文》小篆—[glyph:g007]楷书\\n1《说文》138页。\\n形声字。《说文》：“旭，日旦出兒(貌)。从日，九声。读若勖。一日明也。”“旭”古音与“九”(见纽、幽部)接近，故从“九”得声。五代徐铉以为“九非声”，是因为他不了解古音。“旭”的本义是日出之貌，由此引申出日出之明义以及日出之时义。(王志平)\\n\\n晉(晋) jìn 精纽、真部;精纽、震韵、即刃切。\\n[glyph:g008]1商—[glyph:g009]2西周—[glyph:g010]3春秋—[glyph:g011]4战国—[glyph:g012]8《说文》小篆—[glyph:g013]9汉—[glyph:g014]13汉\\n[glyph:g015]5战国 [glyph:g016]6战国 [glyph:g017]7战国 [glyph:g018]10汉\\n[glyph:g019]11汉 [glyph:g020]12汉\\n[glyph:g021]14汉—[glyph:g022]楷书—[glyph:g023]楷书\\n1《甲文编》284页。2《金文编》456页。3、4、5《金文编》457页。6《类编》494页。7《楚系简帛》565页。8《说文》138页。9《汉印徵》卷7，2页。10、12《银雀山》238页。11、13《篆隶表》443页。14《篆隶表》444页。\\n会意兼形声字。初文从二“矢”，从日。后来二“矢”逐渐演变为“至”字。甲骨文：“……晋扶……”(《合集》19568)古文字中多用为地名，指两周时期的晋国。晋公盆：“晋邦维翰。”(《集成》16.10342)《说文》：“晉，进也。日出万物进。从日，从至。《易》曰：明出地上，晉。”而徐锴系传：“从日，至声。”“至”为日纽、质部字，而“质”部与“真”部是“阴阳对转”的关系，两者古声韵都很接近。所以《说文》分析为形声字。而徐铉、徐锴并以为是会意字，徐铉并云：“至，到也;会意。”二人理解为单纯的会意字，那是因为他们已经不了解古音了。“晉”字《说文》训为“进”，《易·晉卦·彖传》：“晉，进也。明出地上，顺而丽乎大明，柔进而上行。”正是“晉”字的确诂。常见的“晉谒”一词用的就是此义。古书中又用为“抑”。“晉”还可通假为“搢”、“鋑”等等。今简化为“晋”。(王志平)\\n\\n暘(旸) yáng 喻纽、阳部;以纽、阳韵、与章切。\\n[glyph:g024]1战国—[glyph:g025]2《说文》小篆—[glyph:g026]3晋—[glyph:g027]4楷书—[glyph:g028]楷书\\n1《楚系简帛》566页。2《说文》138页。3《篆隶表》444页。\\n形声字。战国文字从日，昜声。《包山楚简》2.187有“正秀暘秋亥”之语，“暘”假借为“阳”。《说文》：“暘，日出也。从日，昜声。《虞书》曰：暘谷。”“昜”是太阳升起之意，所以“暘”字の本义就是“日出”。“暘谷”就是古代神话传说中日出的地方，也作“汤谷”。《书·尧典》：“分命羲仲宅嵎夷，曰暘谷。”“暘”后来也引申出“光明”、“干燥”、“口气”、“日中”等义。“暘”经常可以通假为“阳”、“易”等。今简化为“旸”。(王志平)\\n\\n601\",\n/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0614/ocr-corrected.json:195:        \"before\": \"駒\",\n/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0614/ocr-corrected.json:196:        \"after\": \"馰\",\n/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0614/ocr-corrected.json:198:        \"reason\": \"Original source occurrence independently identified as 馬 plus 勺 (dot/open hook), with complete source-derived crop and same-page printed 勺 control. Earlier 駒 and unresolved receipts preserved. Coordinator original/crop inspection agrees. Source-bound identification of this one occurrence only.\",\n/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0614/p001-identification-evidence-20261003/occurrences.json:11:    \"anchor\": \"此字也通作\",\n/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0614/p001-identification-evidence-20261003/occurrences.json:41:      \"candidate\": \"駒 U+99D2 (馬 + 句)\",\n/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0614/p001-identification-evidence-20261003/occurrences.json:45:      \"character\": \"馰\",\n/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0614/p001-identification-evidence-20261003/occurrences.json:49:    \"geometry_task\": \"Inspect the complete target in the source and enlarged crops. Compare the right-side interior with the actual printed 勺 (U+52FA) in the quotation 从日，勺声 on the same p614 paragraph. 勺 has a dot/open-hook interior; 句 (U+53E5) has a closed 口. State the target geometry and control geometry separately, with attachment references. Do not normalize, simplify, or substitute the left 馬 (U+99AC). Do not rely on meaning, OCR placeholder, or the earlier 駒 verdict. If the source pixels do not show the right-side interior clearly, return unresolved_identity with null printed_text.\"\n/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0614/p001-identification-evidence-20261003/occurrences.json:57:      \"after\": \"馰\",\n/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0614/p001-identification-evidence-20261003/occurrences.json:58:      \"context_before\": \"所引的《易》，今本《易·说卦传》：“为的颡。”“的”是指白额头的马，此字也通作“\",\n/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0614/p001-identification-evidence-20261003/review/result.json:1:{\"occurrences\":[{\"id\":\"ziyuan-2012:p0614:177-189-bounds-verified-disambiguation\",\"raw_text\":\"[glyph:p001]\",\"printed_text\":\"馰\",\"verdict\":\"confirmed_correction\",\"reason\":\"In attachment 3, the complete target immediately follows the paragraph’s “此字也通作” anchor. Its right-side interior shows a dot and an open hook, not a closed 口. Attachment 2 shows the printed control 勺 in “从日，勺声”: that control also has a dot and open-hook interior. The target’s visible right side matches 勺, supporting 馰; the scan therefore distinguishes it from the proposed 駒 with a closed 口.\"}]}\n/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0614/reading-corrected.md:4:形声字。《说文》：“的，明也。从日，勺声。《易》曰：为的颡。”段玉裁注：“的者，白之明也。故俗字作的。”引申为“明确”之义。《礼记·中庸》：“小人之道，的然而日亡。”而《说文》所引的《易》，今本《易·说卦传》：“为的颡。”“的”是指白额头的马，此字也通作“馰”。古书所谓“的卢马”就是指一种黑白相间的马。“的”是指“白”，“卢”是指“黑”。至于“的”的其他义项详见“的”字诸条。(王志平)\n/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0614/p001-identification-evidence-20261003/review/stdout.log:3:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"occurrences\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"ziyuan-2012:p0614:177-189-bounds-verified-disambiguation\\\",\\\"raw_text\\\":\\\"[glyph:p001]\\\",\\\"printed_text\\\":\\\"馰\\\",\\\"verdict\\\":\\\"confirmed_correction\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"In attachment 3, the complete target immediately follows the paragraph’s “此字也通作” anchor. Its right-side interior shows a dot and an open hook, not a closed 口. Attachment 2 shows the printed control 勺 in “从日，勺声”: that control also has a dot and open-hook interior. The target’s visible right side matches 勺, supporting 馰; the scan therefore distinguishes it from the proposed 駒 with a closed 口.\\\"}]}\"}}\n/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0614/p001-identification-evidence-20261003/review/prompt.txt:328:{\"occurrences\": [{\"id\": \"ziyuan-2012:p0614:177-189-bounds-verified-disambiguation\", \"start\": 177, \"end\": 189, \"before\": \"[glyph:p001]\", \"after\": \"馰\", \"context_before\": \"所引的《易》，今本《易·说卦传》：“为的颡。”“的”是指白额头的马，此字也通作“\", \"context_after\": \"”。古书所谓“的卢马”就是指一种黑白相间的马。“的”是指“白”，“卢”是指“黑”\"}], \"provenance\": {\"source_id\": \"ziyuan-2012\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"bibliography\": \"李學勤主編《字源》, 天津古籍出版社 / 遼寧人民出版社, 2012, ISBN 9787552800692\", \"pdf_page\": 614, \"printed_page\": 601, \"raw_span_start\": 177, \"raw_span_end\": 189, \"raw_text\": \"[glyph:p001]\", \"anchor\": \"此字也通作\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0614/source.png\", \"source_file_sha256\": \"5780bde47bb2fab153868ddf33db259f0d3ccd75d42ba65b80a26a4f23f15bdc\", \"source_page_pixel_sha256\": \"e5c3740499352373582e7a99de9e1114ed3590dd728207f268e6ffe5cd3cbf88\", \"paragraph_c